<title>USA: Quilmes to buy Cerveceria stake.</title>
<headline>Quilmes to buy Cerveceria stake.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quilmes Industrial SA said it exercised an option to buy 85 percent of the Argentine brewing company Cerveceria Bieckert SA, and expects its 1996 results to be &quot;comparable&quot; with 1995 results.</p>
<p>The option to buy Cerveceria, which had a 6.5 percent share of Argentina's brewing market in 1995, values Cerveceria at $40 million, including financial debt, Quilmes said. The purchase is still subject to certain conditions and to the completion of the due diligence process, it added.</p>
</text>
